
                       geant4-11-04-ref-01
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o General modernization of code in g4tools externals.
 o Introduced UI command "/run/undertakeOptimisation" to force geometry
   optimization and added to G4RunMessenger.
 o Updated header guards to style/format according to coding guidelines
   in most modules.
 
---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.4.1

